confd (0.1.0-6) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Fix ietf-interfaces plugin crash on incomplete IPv6 neighbors.
  * Switch sysrepo-plugins submodule to henrymao-zz fork (ubuntu-2604
    branch) which fixes SR_ERR_INVAL_ARG when nl_addr2str returns "none"
    for neighbors with no resolved link-layer address (NUD_INCOMPLETE).

 -- Henry Mao <henry.mao@canonical.com>  Sun, 14 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0800

confd (0.1.0-5) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Fix libumgmt.so missing from package: umgmt installs to
    x86_64-linux-gnu, not lib/. Try both paths.

 -- Henry Mao <henry.mao@canonical.com>  Sat, 13 Sep 2026 17:00:00 +0800

confd (0.1.0-4) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Fix plugin loading: add runtime dependencies for system libraries.
  * Plugins need libnl-route-3-200, libnftables1, libsdbus-c++2, etc.
  * Fix symlink preservation for bundled .so files (use cp -d).
  * Add dlerror() logging when dlopen fails for debugging.

 -- Henry Mao <henry.mao@canonical.com>  Sat, 13 Sep 2026 16:30:00 +0800

confd (0.1.0-3) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Fix Go build on PPA: set GOCACHE/GOTMPDIR to writable dirs.
  * PPA build environment uses HOME=/sbuild-nonexistent which doesn't exist.

 -- Henry Mao <henry.mao@canonical.com>  Sat, 13 Sep 2026 15:10:00 +0800

